From 26f47bf0c5ce26c846093ad8c34346ce3e1df616 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:30:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): keep draft placement fresh without changing
 send [daveey]

Restore the exact pre-PR inline first-send cwd calculation and original
optimistic insertion. Resolve sidebar placement only at render time, with
subscriptions to tree, profile, connection and configured-default inputs.
Make the configured default observable while preserving the public setter
and getter semantics. Scope display borrowing to the exact open tile id.

Why: the shared computed fallback omitted inputs and retained a stale cwd.
Earlier fixes adjusted writers instead of preserving the send boundary.
The replacement display hook explicitly opts out of React Compiler memo
hoisting because it reads fallback stores imperatively.

Proof: five regression cases fail on ec2a2c2a; focused 35 tests green,
sidebar 81 files/1095 tests green, actions/store/browser 44 files/734 tests
green, full tsc clean, scripts/check all 21 clean. Restored send block has
no diff against origin/main. An over-broad hooks batch timed out and was
replaced by the bounded passing batch. Independent exact-head review and
required CI remain mandatory before canonical ship landing.
